### ========================================================
### PENGUJIAN LATIHAN E.2: UJI HAK AKSES MANUAL OLEH VIEWER
### ========================================================

### LANGKAH 1: Login sebagai Viewer (Mendapatkan Sesi/Cookie)
POST http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/login.php
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "user@speedboat.com",
    "password": "User123!"
}

### LANGKAH 2: Uji Request DELETE Secara Manual
### Ekspektasi Balasan Server: 403 Forbidden (Akses Ditolak)
DELETE http://localhost/pemweb-obe/api/jadwal.php?id=1
Accept: application/json